tensive activity (general, unspecified mechanism)","predicate":"reported to have","stance":"reported","subject":"morin","text":"Morin is listed as having antihypertensive activity among other effects; no blood pressure, cardiac or ischemia data are given in this section."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t9_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t9_c4","object":"Nrf2 signaling in PIG1 melanocytes","predicate":"reported to increase antioxidant enzymes via","stance":"reported","subject":"paeonol","text":"Paeonol is reported to raise SOD, CAT and GSH-Px activity and HO-1, NQO1 and SOD2 expression via Nrf2 in H2O2-stressed PIG1 melanocytes, acting protectively without affecting melanogenesis; no cardiac link is drawn."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t9_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t9_c5","object":"Nrf2 signaling through JNK pathway activation (cellular, not cardiac)","predicate":"reported to exert cellular antioxidant activity via","stance":"reported","subject":"6-shogaol","text":"6-shogaol is reported to exert cellular antioxidant activity by mediating Nrf2 signaling through JNK pathway activation, a cellular finding with no cardiac or ferroptosis context."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t9_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t9_c7","object":"PI3K/Akt signaling activation (melanocytes only)","predicate":"reported to protect melanocytes via","stance":"reported","subject":"geniposide","text":"Geniposide is reported to protect H2O2-treated melanocytes by raising SOD and CAT and inhibiting apoptosis via PI3K/Akt activation; no cardiac or baicalin content is present."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t9_o7"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t9_c8","object":"anti-inflammatory and anti-oxidation activities (general)","predicate":"reported to have","stance":"reported","subject":"rosmarinic acid","text":"Rosmarinic acid is listed as having anti-inflammatory and anti-oxidation activities; the section gives no cardiac, ischemia or ferroptosis data for it."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76f