tes"]},{"doc_id":"d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76ffb10084f742cc5447f83253bc2fae9f6b","exact_quote":"Therefore, MADE is a promising natural product against vitiligo (Ling et al., 2017).","kind":"observe","local_id":"t11_o4","terms":["madecassoside vitiligo context"]},{"doc_id":"d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76ffb10084f742cc5447f83253bc2fae9f6b","exact_quote":"The mechanism may provide an antioxidant effect by regulating the PI3K/Akt signaling pathway","kind":"observe","local_id":"t11_o5","terms":["psoralidin proposed antioxidant mechanism, hedged with may"]},{"doc_id":"d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76ffb10084f742cc5447f83253bc2fae9f6b","exact_quote":"PL is beneficial to diabetic complications, oxidative stress, obesity, osteoporosis, apoptosis, autophagy and cell proliferation (Sharifi-Rad et al., 2020).","kind":"observe","local_id":"t11_o6","terms":["psoralidin broad benefits, general source, no heart data"]},{"doc_id":"d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76ffb10084f742cc5447f83253bc2fae9f6b","exact_quote":"SP has been reported to have anti-inflammatory effect (Chaingam et al., 2020) and antioxidant effect (Usman et al., 2020)","kind":"observe","local_id":"t11_o7","terms":["scopoletin anti-inflammatory and antioxidant reports"]},{"doc_id":"d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76ffb10084f742cc5447f83253bc2fae9f6b","exact_quote":"Isofraxidin related derivatives have been found to have anti-inflammatory, antioxidant, neuroprotective and other biological activities","kind":"observe","local_id":"t11_o8","terms":["isofraxidin derivatives general bioactivities"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t11_o1","t11_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t11_c1","object":"liver injury protection, lipid balance, immune regulation, antioxidant (general)","predicate":"reported to have pharmacological activities including","stance":"reported","subject":"Cistanche deserticola polysaccharide (CDP)","text":"CDP is reported to have liver-protective, lipid-balancing, immune-regulating and antioxidant activities, citing Liu et al. 2018; the section gives no cardiac, ischemia/reperfusion or ferroptosis data for it."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t11_o3","t11_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t11_c2","object":"autophagy upregulation in H2O2-stressed melanocytes (vitiligo context)","predicate":"reported to exert antioxidant activity via","stance":"reported","subject":"madecassoside (MADE)","text":"Madecassoside is reported to exert antioxidant activity by increasing autophagy (LC3-II/LC3-I upregulation) in H2O2-stressed melanocytes and is called a promising anti-vitiligo product; no heart or ferroptosis data appear."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t11_o5","t11_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t11_c3","object":"antioxidant effect via PI3K/Akt and Nrf2/HO-1 axis","predicate":"proposed mechanism (hedged) for","stance":"open","subject":"psoralidin (PL)","text":"For psoralidin, the section proposes that antioxidant effects may arise via PI3K/Akt, GSK3beta/beta-catenin and Nrf2/HO-1 signalling; this is a hedged mechanism with no cardiac or ischemia/reperfusion evidence."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76ffb10084f742cc5447f83253bc2fae9f6b"],"ranges":[["d_2334c21c827f6b7bc5ae2521186c76ffb10084f742cc5447f83253bc2fae9f6b",49431,55110]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"85bdba15d40ba352f864410aff6de64716447c59f0dde0b3fb89b29e5554dfe2","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["bb37991aef12e99915a3f316bfa9de63de708da5666b7da8cd97f8c6ba0154ed","4e47ba8f1f351bcddd119aba0437f7266d4a79bfcdfab3bbdce44192640cdfaa","b459d77969d8735f3fcc8307169ae1a3f4ae4e9a82c07e1252f243af60782c54","f02e5513210d142bf8e658de5ba36400f5c7fa5300b7ac54b719f585d83258f5","a848ea222360226243938364f40eca0974b9b17f2fef0699896cf51c35e408c9","b6a74be875916106bbd820591bebf12c8b15ef2698dfd6d11db8437bc30e078c","ede7d7552103347a264928bd4722b0d3b5a05baca84751489cce5a320ef11145","2eb8cdcb626f4473785632b090a9809fb94672771f0d0e7e5747e88258d7b2a0","60ca9058f1c51ea19a8144981ffda444f8cd80f0d0cb5a004dabc483d1f8ca21","89aed3