{"body":{"actor":"w1","audit_root":"df6b4c1a84f189d262daeb21de0a76540046821ab6e48e39d7eb50f746888ef2","command":{"allowed_records":["365ae9fb0cc44e725fa0d2de0689fec700d542b00dcf815a3dcd3dec48fe3889","4a7b9b4b679f4a3e457033edb67d814162543a07bbd6607182b84c552168225f","68d496f719eefdeadd68cc8fa1c507aa91d6e156b39c7b8e4266c9ceaf46c5ef","69ae6f64ae891c52f8ae1941cf20ce71cb78926c6b047390234a4a06e8c520b0","6f0ff3bf9ad296c5661b98fe021f26761a38e5bbf05983577bf7b3322e76eb77","72bb7299aeed4327bb9a52d6503efcb56be03d734738368149981ecf6912dc95","9026b2ce369c12781d95960bd95ed7f8fe3745adfa12204c62340bd8d77344c7","a400583ce667ce35482f11198679bfb202abd3949671e75fd709db3195831a0c","a84be80a6986ad7f7b387ffa2dce2ef2d38f4cf0ec25289700d894594af2c536","c1c7d8e99994e3cc3629519b9ce5a5feb3379830cbf730f10f1f90f245e9d808","c473d66009fc579f4bd443ed3238a310b97d74bfce00047cff8ddd8350853d69","dcb10951c982480fbffb7a64236be2e7e6f6183f0750f14a98bcbc56c9c06d95"],"directive":"T15-5a2530393dc80006","kind":"submit","lines":[{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"The knockdown of the ACSL-4 gene in breast cancer cells can lead to a significant reduction in PUFA-PE production and suppress ferroptosis [26].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o1","terms":["ACSL-4 knockdown","breast cancer cells","PUFA-PE","ferroptosis"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Therefore, decreasing ACSL-4 and LOX can effectively inhibit the action of PUFA-PE and suppress the onset of ferroptosis [25].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o2","terms":["ACSL-4 and LOX decrease","PUFA-PE action","ferroptosis onset"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Furthermore, thiazolidinediones specifically inhibit ACSL-4, thereby suppressing ferroptosis [23, 27].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o3","terms":["thiazolidinediones","ACSL-4 inhibition","ferroptosis suppression"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"PUFA can be acylated under the catalysis of acyl-CoA synthetase long-chain family member-4 (ACSL-4) to produce PUFA acyl-CoA (PUFA-CoA)","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o4","terms":["ACSL-4 acylation of PUFA","PUFA-CoA production","upstream of PUFA-PE"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Zileuton (a 5-LOX inhibitor) can also inhibit erastin and ferroptosis in HT22 neuronal cells [28].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o5","terms":["zileuton","5-LOX inhibition","HT22 neuronal cells"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"HSPB-1 can inhibit TFR-1, which results in lower iron ion concentration, thereby further suppressing the occurrence of ferroptosis [22].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o6","terms":["HSPB-1","TFR-1 inhibition","iron concentration","ferroptosis"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"This implies that the IREB-2 expression can indirectly interfere with iron adsorption and inhibit ferroptosis [1, 21].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o7","terms":["IREB-2","iron adsorption","ferroptosis inhibition"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"heme oxygenase-1 (HO-1) was found to lead to ferroptosis by increasing intracellular iron and mediating lipid peroxidation reactions [19].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t15_o8","terms":["HO-1 pro-ferroptotic role","intracellular iron","lipid peroxidation"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o1"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c1","object":"breast cancer cells","predicate":"reported to suppress ferroptosis when knocked down in","stance":"reported","subject":"ACSL-4","text":"ACSL-4 knockdown is reported to reduce PUFA-PE production and suppress ferroptosis in breast cancer cells, citing a single study; no cardiac context is given."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c2","object":"ferroptosis","predicate":"reported to suppress onset of","stance":"reported","subject":"ACSL-4 and LOX","text":"Decreasing ACSL-4 and LOX is reported to inhibit PUFA-PE action and suppress the onset of ferroptosis, as a general statement without tissue or injury model."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c3","object":"PUFA-CoA, upstream of PUFA-PE","predicate":"reported to catalyze acylation of PUFA to","stance":"reported","subject":"ACSL-4","text":"ACSL-4 is described as acylating PUFA to PUFA-CoA, which then forms PUFA-PE, placing ACSL-4 upstream in lipid ROS formation."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c4","object":"ACSL-4, suppressing ferroptosis","predicate":"reported to specifically inhibit","stance":"reported","subject":"thiazolidinediones","text":"Thiazolidinediones are reported to specifically inhibit ACSL-4 and thereby suppress ferroptosis, citing two sources; no cardiac or ischemia data are given."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c5","object":"HT22 neuronal cells","predicate":"reported to inhibit erastin and ferroptosis in","stance":"reported","subject":"zileuton","text":"Zileuton, a 5-LOX inhibitor, is reported to inhibit erastin-induced ferroptosis in HT22 neuronal cells; this is neuronal, not cardiac."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c6","object":"TFR-1 and lowering iron concentration","predicate":"reported to suppress ferroptosis by inhibiting","stance":"reported","subject":"HSPB-1","text":"HSPB-1 is reported to inhibit TFR-1, lowering iron concentration and further suppressing ferroptosis; mechanism stated, no injury model given."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o7"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c7","object":"iron adsorption and ferroptosis","predicate":"reported to indirectly inhibit","stance":"reported","subject":"IREB-2","text":"IREB-2 expression is reported to indirectly limit iron uptake and inhibit ferroptosis, a statement that the source frames as an implication."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o8"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c8","object":"ferroptosis via iron increase and lipid peroxidation","predicate":"reported to lead to","stance":"reported","subject":"heme oxygenase-1 (HO-1)","text":"Heme oxygenase-1 is reported to lead to ferroptosis by raising intracellular iron and mediating lipid peroxidation, a pro-ferroptotic role opposite to the protective examples above."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o1","t15_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c9","object":"cardiac ischemia/reperfusion ferroptosis inhibition by ACSL-4 or compounds","predicate":"does not establish","stance":"open","subject":"section d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","text":"This section gives no myocardial ischemia/reperfusion, cardioprotection or baicalin evidence; its ferroptosis examples are from breast cancer and HT22 neuronal cells."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t15_o3","t15_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t15_c10","object":"this section","predicate":"reported as ferroptosis inhibitors but not cardiac-linked in","stance":"reported","subject":"thiazolidinediones and zileuton","text":"Compounds named as ferroptosis inhibitors here are thiazolidinediones and zileuton, not natural products tied to heart protection."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3"],"ranges":[["d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3",5214,9570]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"6895eef6c32ee1f2fca9024d9996ca76982cc9bad47cce1dfe025c9af4e88965","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["f20bea357cb4181107abbec9ad3824f727bc5b50a61ad44c357525cdf154c970","788f24f6a0cfe92fda00a36b314899f9ea4e043be7a8fb965bd033f33f7730ce","7f5c67aec04f0048a6e940abc9a218a855e0265a50a0d659fd0841407e269aa6","62df9f59f7fc0f7b02dd