{"body":{"actor":"w1","audit_root":"19b6564ed4f76bd386d55c213963ad9433dc4d00930346ca309b9f3a14eedc67","command":{"allowed_records":["365ae9fb0cc44e725fa0d2de0689fec700d542b00dcf815a3dcd3dec48fe3889","4a7b9b4b679f4a3e457033edb67d814162543a07bbd6607182b84c552168225f","68d496f719eefdeadd68cc8fa1c507aa91d6e156b39c7b8e4266c9ceaf46c5ef","69ae6f64ae891c52f8ae1941cf20ce71cb78926c6b047390234a4a06e8c520b0","6f0ff3bf9ad296c5661b98fe021f26761a38e5bbf05983577bf7b3322e76eb77","72bb7299aeed4327bb9a52d6503efcb56be03d734738368149981ecf6912dc95","9026b2ce369c12781d95960bd95ed7f8fe3745adfa12204c62340bd8d77344c7","a400583ce667ce35482f11198679bfb202abd3949671e75fd709db3195831a0c","a84be80a6986ad7f7b387ffa2dce2ef2d38f4cf0ec25289700d894594af2c536","c1c7d8e99994e3cc3629519b9ce5a5feb3379830cbf730f10f1f90f245e9d808","c473d66009fc579f4bd443ed3238a310b97d74bfce00047cff8ddd8350853d69","dcb10951c982480fbffb7a64236be2e7e6f6183f0750f14a98bcbc56c9c06d95"],"directive":"T20-c23d6b35f1dc9699","kind":"submit","lines":[{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Ferroptosis is closely related to autophagy.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o1","terms":["ferroptosis and autophagy relation"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"ELAVL-1 also inhibits ferroptosis and MIRI, restores GPX-4 expression level, restores cardiomyocyte viability, and attenuates cardiomyocyte injury.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o2","terms":["ELAVL-1 protective effect against ferroptosis in MIRI","GPX-4 restoration"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Low levels of ELAVL-1 can inhibit MIRI-induced autophagy, suppress ferroptosis, and attenuate myocardial infarct size and MIRI.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o3","terms":["low ELAVL-1 effect on autophagy, ferroptosis and infarct size"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"its underlying mechanisms of action remain poorly understood.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o4","terms":["open mechanism of autophagy-regulated ferroptosis in MIRI"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"iron ion levels and ROS were significantly enhanced in the cardiomyocytes of MIRI rats","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o5","terms":["iron, ROS and ferroptosis markers in MIRI rats"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"the ELAVL-1 protein is able to bind specifically with the autophagy-related protein beclin 1","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o6","terms":["ELAVL-1 and beclin 1 binding in autophagy-ferroptosis link"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"FOXC-1 transcription activates ELAVL-1, and the ELAVL-1-mediated enhancement of the autophagic ferroptosis pathway has a significant impact on MIRI.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o7","terms":["FOXC-1 to ELAVL-1 axis in autophagic ferroptosis"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"During MIRI, decreased GSH and GPX-4 levels can lead to elevated ELAVL-1","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o8","terms":["GSH and GPX-4 decrease upstream of ELAVL-1"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"where the significant increase in ELAV-1 is accompanied by the excessive production of ROS and inflammatory cytokines","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o9","terms":["ELAVL-1 increase with ROS and inflammation"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Therefore, the relationship between FOXC-1 and ELAVL-1, as well as its association with ferroptosis, could serve as useful targets against MIRI.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t20_o10","terms":["proposed targets against MIRI"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t20_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t20_c1","object":"ferroptosis and MIRI; restores GPX-4 expression","predicate":"reported to inhibit","stance":"reported","subject":"ELAVL-1","text":"ELAVL-1, a protein rather than a compound, is reported to inhibit ferroptosis and MIRI, restore GPX-4 expression, and attenuate cardiomyocyte injury; evidence is cited to other studies, not detailed here."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t20_o2","t20_o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t20_c2","object":"ferroptosis and myocardial infarct size in MIRI","predicate":"stated to suppress ferroptosis at both high and low levels","stance":"qualified","subject":"ELAVL-1 level","text":"The section states both that ELAVL-1 inhibits ferroptosis and that low ELAVL-1 suppresses ferroptosis and infarct size; the direction of ELAVL-1 effect is internally unresolved."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t20_o1","t20_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t20_c3","object":"ferroptosis activation during MIRI","predicate":"reported to depend on; mechanism described as poorly understood","stance":"open","subject":"autophagy-ferroptosis link in cardiomyocytes","text":"Ferroptosis in cardiomyocytes is reported to depend on autophagy induction, but the underlying mechanisms of this autophagy-ferroptosis link are described as poorly understood."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t20_o6"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t20_c4","object":"autophagy and the ferroptotic pathway in cardiomyocytes","predicate":"reported to bind beclin 1 and activate","stance":"reported","subject":"ELAVL-1","text":"ELAVL-1 is reported to bind beclin 1 to decrease P62 and increase LC3, thereby raising cardiomyocyte autophagy and activating the ferroptotic pathway, citing another study."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t20_o7"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t20_c5","object":"ELAVL-1, in the autophagic ferroptosis pathway during MIRI","predicate":"reported to activate transcription of","stance":"reported","subject":"FOXC-1","text":"FOXC-1 transcription is reported to activate ELAVL-1, and the ELAVL-1-mediated autophagic ferroptosis pathway is reported to affect MIRI."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t20_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t20_c6","object":"ferroptosis involvement in MIRI pathogenesis","predicate":"reported to show raised iron and ROS with reduced GPX-4 and GSH","stance":"reported","subject":"MIRI rat cardiomyocytes","text":"In MIRI rat cardiomyocytes, iron ions and ROS are reported to rise while GPX-4 and GSH fall, which is taken to suggest ferroptosis is involved in MIRI pathogenesis."},{"based_on":["t20_o2","t20_o3","t20_o7"],"falsifier":"A study showing consistent direction of ELAVL-1 effect on ferroptosis across autophagy and redox conditions would refute it.","kind":"hypothesis","local_id":"t20_h1","text":"The effect of ELAVL-1 on ferroptosis in MIRI is context-dependent, with protective versus harmful direction set by autophagy and redox state rather than by ELAVL-1 level alone."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3"],"ranges":[["d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3",25928,30722]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"6de4804811a9e0f9799e5c1d01de23657a7dcff687d30c2976d31e514a67e239","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["959df9b3fa70c46ab6965de0c6f738357e20cd40d4666f2d21e171370b6d01d7","ea51a2401a2f5b32288b97479382a48052f076e41ba13e822ef3b43088a3942c","d47b7540a248eecfa8518accebb97f05a55e6812c4a46279e6c0ecc7ed360e12","6a4913c301d21a75ddb0b711f75675e92eb917a389b7b41c32130c01cbcfeada","925ffc6e736adc5a2a19bdf9131038ca6eeb058fd123d9f78682b6fc9bba0720","25d4189e67f872873b0649ccb61b3687f7239795670457fb7a85954b558c714b","b435fd4c5faf9a9d31c2f3e64e461e94effcedeef1841170e4612eebec8e8280","a32608be7872f861a7e7bc916ada5e8bc6ab00b0b11bb8f7dc078dd52b37b45a","6b39484330a982e41602593434426f8966d910e793756b7fb88474a1796a8c5a","0eadd80013dc92aa2ce738bb99f2d3d171c3b317b94da2455238d9a44edb5601","65b2da7c5447d7ca4e6fbc6198bd69e8955b70