{"body":{"actor":"w1","audit_root":"36f483ee64a78220dce23764c41f88dffc15b74b55d9492332fb2c4f73a172c6","command":{"allowed_records":["365ae9fb0cc44e725fa0d2de0689fec700d542b00dcf815a3dcd3dec48fe3889","4a7b9b4b679f4a3e457033edb67d814162543a07bbd6607182b84c552168225f","68d496f719eefdeadd68cc8fa1c507aa91d6e156b39c7b8e4266c9ceaf46c5ef","69ae6f64ae891c52f8ae1941cf20ce71cb78926c6b047390234a4a06e8c520b0","6f0ff3bf9ad296c5661b98fe021f26761a38e5bbf05983577bf7b3322e76eb77","72bb7299aeed4327bb9a52d6503efcb56be03d734738368149981ecf6912dc95","9026b2ce369c12781d95960bd95ed7f8fe3745adfa12204c62340bd8d77344c7","a400583ce667ce35482f11198679bfb202abd3949671e75fd709db3195831a0c","a84be80a6986ad7f7b387ffa2dce2ef2d38f4cf0ec25289700d894594af2c536","c1c7d8e99994e3cc3629519b9ce5a5feb3379830cbf730f10f1f90f245e9d808","c473d66009fc579f4bd443ed3238a310b97d74bfce00047cff8ddd8350853d69","dcb10951c982480fbffb7a64236be2e7e6f6183f0750f14a98bcbc56c9c06d95"],"directive":"T21-9358dbc4caab3318","kind":"submit","lines":[{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Pretreatment of MIRI mice with ferrostatin-1 (Fer-1, an inhibitor of ferroptosis) or dexrazoxane (an iron chelating agent)","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o1","terms":["Fer-1 and dexrazoxane pretreatment in MIRI mice","ferroptosis inhibitors"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"significantly increased the expression level of Ptgs2 mRNA, which further led to a reduction in the myocardial enzyme spectrum and the scar area of myocardial infarction [64].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o2","terms":["Ptgs2 mRNA increase and reduced infarct scar","outcome of Fer-1/dexrazoxane"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"liproxstatin-1 (Lip-1) treatment maintained the structure and function of mitochondria after MIRI by reducing VDAC-1 levels and restoring GPX4 protein levels [70].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o3","terms":["liproxstatin-1 mitochondrial protection","VDAC-1 and GPX4 in MIRI"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Overexpression of USP22 and inhibition of glutaminase can alleviate MIRI by inhibiting ferroptosis [7, 71].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o4","terms":["USP22 and glutaminase as ferroptosis targets in MIRI"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"it was found that ACSL4-mediated ferroptosis was a promising target for MIRI treatment, and baicalin can prevent MIRI by inhibiting ACSL-4-mediated ferroptosis [82].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o5","terms":["ACSL4 role in MIRI","baicalin prevents MIRI via ACSL4-mediated ferroptosis","rat MIRI model and OGD/R H9c2 cells"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"A recent study found that dexrazoxane or ponatinib inhibited ferroptosis during MIRI","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o6","terms":["dexrazoxane and ponatinib ferroptosis inhibition"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"a combined treatment with both drugs markedly reduced the scar area of myocardial infarction.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o7","terms":["combined dexrazoxane and ponatinib scar reduction"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"percutaneous coronary intervention before myocardial reperfusion could not significantly reduce the scar area of myocardial infarction [83].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o8","terms":["PCI before reperfusion in elevated-ST patients","limits of reperfusion alone"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"phosphatidylcholine oxide content increased dramatically during MIRI, leading to reduced GPX-4 activity and ferroptosis.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o9","terms":["oxidized phosphatidylcholine in MIRI","GPX-4 activity loss"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Fer-1 can inhibit OxPC-triggered ferroptosis [84].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o10","terms":["Fer-1 inhibits OxPC-triggered ferroptosis"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Cyanidin-3-glucoside (C3G) treatment can effectively alleviate the expression of proteins related to apoptosis, reduce Fe^2+ content, and improve MIRI.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o11","terms":["cyanidin-3-glucoside protection in MIRI"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Fer-1 alleviates ERS, reduces cellular injury in H9c2 cells, and mitigates myocardial cell injury during diabetic MIRI.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o12","terms":["Fer-1 in diabetic MIRI"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"inhibition of nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide phosphate oxidase-2 (NOX-2) can alleviate MIRI in diabetic rats [56, 86].","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o13","terms":["NOX-2 inhibition in diabetic MIRI"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Fer-1 reduces myocardial cell death and blocks the recruitment of neutrophil granulocytes to damaged myocardial cells","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o14","terms":["Fer-1 after heart transplantation","neutrophil recruitment and DAMPs"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"Other drugs, such as piperlongumine, isothiocyanates, and artemisinin, may exert cardiomyocyte protective effects by inhibiting ferroptosis.","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o15","terms":["piperlongumine, isothiocyanates, artemisinin as possible ferroptosis inhibitors"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"articles related to the effects of Chinese medicines and other drugs on MIRI are still scarce, which warrants further investigation","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o16","terms":["evidence gap for Chinese medicines in MIRI"]},{"doc_id":"d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3","exact_quote":"the precise stage of MIRI at which ferroptosis mainly occurs have not been located","kind":"observe","local_id":"t21_o17","terms":["timing of ferroptosis within MIRI stages"]},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o1","t21_o2"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c1","object":"increased Ptgs2 mRNA (mechanism unexplained)","predicate":"reported to reduce scar area in MIRI mice via","stance":"qualified","subject":"Fer-1 and dexrazoxane","text":"Fer-1 or dexrazoxane pretreatment in MIRI mice is reported to raise Ptgs2 mRNA and reduce enzyme spectrum and infarct scar. The Ptgs2 rise is linked to benefit without mechanism, so the account is qualified."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o3"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c2","object":"reduced VDAC-1 and restored GPX4","predicate":"reported to protect mitochondria in MIRI via","stance":"reported","subject":"liproxstatin-1 (Lip-1)","text":"Liproxstatin-1 is reported to preserve mitochondrial structure and function after MIRI by reducing VDAC-1 and restoring GPX4 protein."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o4"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c3","object":"inhibiting ferroptosis","predicate":"reported to alleviate MIRI by","stance":"reported","subject":"USP22 overexpression; glutaminase inhibition","text":"USP22 overexpression and glutaminase inhibition are reported to alleviate MIRI by inhibiting ferroptosis, citing refs 7 and 71."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o5"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c4","object":"ACSL4-mediated ferroptosis","predicate":"reported to prevent MIRI by inhibiting","stance":"reported","subject":"baicalin; ACSL4","text":"ACSL4-mediated ferroptosis is reported as a promising MIRI target. Baicalin is reported to prevent MIRI by inhibiting ACSL4-mediated ferroptosis, shown in a rat MIRI model and OGD/R H9c2 cells (ref 82)."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o6","t21_o7","t21_o8"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c5","object":"combined dexrazoxane plus ponatinib","predicate":"reported to inhibit ferroptosis and reduce scar; PCI reported not significant","stance":"reported","subject":"dexrazoxane, ponatinib, PCI","text":"Dexrazoxane or ponatinib is reported to inhibit MIRI ferroptosis; combined use reported to markedly reduce scar. PCI before reperfusion reported not to significantly reduce scar in elevated-ST patients (ref 83)."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o9","t21_o10"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c6","object":"OxPC-triggered ferroptosis","predicate":"reported to drive ferroptosis via GPX-4 loss; Fer-1 reported to inhibit","stance":"reported","subject":"oxidized phosphatidylcholine (OxPC); Fer-1","text":"Oxidized phosphatidylcholine is reported to rise in MIRI, reducing GPX-4 activity and driving ferroptosis; Fer-1 is reported to inhibit this OxPC-triggered ferroptosis (ref 84)."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o11"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c7","object":"MIRI injury","predicate":"reported to improve MIRI by reducing apoptosis proteins and Fe2+","stance":"reported","subject":"cyanidin-3-glucoside (C3G)","text":"Cyanidin-3-glucoside (C3G) is reported to reduce apoptosis-related protein expression and Fe2+ content and improve MIRI, proposed as a potential preventive medicine (ref 85)."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o12","t21_o13"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c8","object":"ER stress, NOX-2-related oxidative stress and apoptosis","predicate":"reported to alleviate diabetic MIRI","stance":"reported","subject":"Fer-1; NOX-2 inhibition","text":"In diabetic MIRI, Fer-1 is reported to alleviate ER stress and injury in H9c2 cells; NOX-2 inhibition is reported to alleviate MIRI in diabetic rats (refs 56, 86)."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o14"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c9","object":"blocking DAMP-driven neutrophil recruitment","predicate":"reported to reduce myocardial death after heart transplantation by","stance":"reported","subject":"Fer-1","text":"Fer-1 is reported to reduce myocardial cell death and block neutrophil recruitment by DAMPs after heart transplantation, suggesting ferroptosis targeting for transplant patients (ref 87)."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o15"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c10","object":"inhibiting ferroptosis","predicate":"may exert cardiomyocyte protection by","stance":"open","subject":"piperlongumine, isothiocyanates, artemisinin","text":"Piperlongumine, isothiocyanates and artemisinin may protect cardiomyocytes by inhibiting ferroptosis; the text gives no supporting data for them."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o16"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c11","object":"scarce, warranting further investigation","predicate":"evidence is","stance":"open","subject":"Chinese medicines and other drugs in MIRI","text":"The section states that articles on Chinese medicines and other drugs in MIRI are scarce, so their effects remain under-studied."},{"as_of":null,"based_on":["t21_o17"],"kind":"claim","local_id":"t21_c12","object":"precise stage of MIRI","predicate":"has not been located","stance":"open","subject":"ferroptosis timing in MIRI","text":"The precise stage of MIRI at which ferroptosis mainly occurs has not been located; incidence differs across stages."}],"scope":{"docs":["d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3"],"ranges":[["d_a4ddf8ee6d280b8bf83b9085b69d8b452885166ab36aa6da396cd4b3b96a32e3",30722,35435]],"topic":null}},"engine_root":"fc4310bdc048408ea6954083d08498d338c2c8ccfa969a9788dc7ceaefa3aed8","outcome":{"kind":"records","result":{"accepted":["f569e8ce84972adb635915a984eed928039b75595aff40ef4db98ea315934dc2","171af636efb0b58430375dc511e407377662ed1ec40cdf1ffb0dfcba05484fa0","4884a7ab3a1dca